{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-d18a2e859415","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-d18a2e859415","name":"奇异果菠菜特调","category":"drink","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/drink/%E5%A5%87%E5%BC%82%E6%9E%9C%E8%8F%A0%E8%8F%9C%E7%89%B9%E8%B0%83/%E5%A5%87%E5%BC%82%E6%9E%9C%E8%8F%A0%E8%8F%9C%E7%89%B9%E8%B0%83.md","blob_sha":"2e288e1de21002c98b2753228b3b55e59747b85c","details":{"introduction":"这是一道清爽健康的果蔬特饮，口感酸甜细腻，带有奇异果与苹果的天然果香，菠菜味清淡不抢。富含维生素 C 和膳食纤维，有助于促进消化。制作非常简单，新手也能一次成功，全程预计只需 10 分钟。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 原料:\n  - 奇异果\n  - 苹果\n  - 菠菜叶（ 2-5 片）\n  - 水\n  - 白砂糖\n- 工具\n  - 榨汁机"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 饮用水 700ml\n- 奇异果 2 个\n- 苹果 1/2 个\n- 菠菜叶 4 叶\n- 白砂糖 12 克"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将猕猴桃切成两半，每半再分四份小块\n2. 将苹果切丁\n3. 将菠菜叶去梗，只留叶子部分\n4. 将菠菜切碎\n5. 一起倒入榨汁机搅拌杯\n6. 注水\n7. 加入白砂糖\n8. 启动搅拌机，搅拌约 4 个 15 秒（每 15 秒停下看状态）"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 关于白砂糖的量：全糖为 12g，可根据个人情况在 0-12g 中调整\n- 本品是仿照宜家的奇异果菠菜汁自己研制的，没有宜家的好喝，但也不错\n- 欢迎改进！\n\n### 成品"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去皮奇异果200g、菠菜80g、饮用水250g、白砂糖20g；整份约550g。去皮奇异果和菠菜全果打匀，不过滤弃渣。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":39.6,"protein_g":0.830545,"carbohydrate_g":9.509818,"fat_g":0.245818},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients","version":"caa00babe1e763fe","fdc_ids":[168153,168462,173647,169655]},"profile_id":"family-d18a2e859415-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-d18a2e859415","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-d18a2e859415","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-d18a2e859415-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"kiwi","grams":200},{"key":"spinach","grams":80},{"key":"water","grams":250},{"key":"sugar","grams":20}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"caa00babe1e763fe","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-d18a2e859415-v1.19de94a730d508e2.json","bytes":19877,"sha256":"19de94a730d508e296245cc316c2fcaf9cb2b90e4f855f7c3792cd509d6b64ed"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-d18a2e859415-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-d18a2e859415","recipe_blob_sha":"2e288e1de21002c98b2753228b3b55e59747b85c","version":"1","data_version":"caa00babe1e763fe","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去皮奇异果200g、菠菜80g、饮用水250g、白砂糖20g；整份约550g。去皮奇异果和菠菜全果打匀，不过滤弃渣。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-d18a2e859415","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-d18a2e859415-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"kiwi","grams":200},{"key":"spinach","grams":80},{"key":"water","grams":250},{"key":"sugar","grams":20}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":39.6,"protein_g":0.830545,"carbohydrate_g":9.509818,"fat_g":0.245818},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168153/nutrients","version":"caa00babe1e763fe","fdc_ids":[168153,168462,173647,169655]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-d18a2e859415-v1.19de94a730d508e2.json","bytes":19877,"sha2